      "fp_reason": "The POST /contact endpoint is the intentional backend for the public SubscriptionFormBlock. The nonce is exposed to frontend visitors via Block::enqueue_block_script() which calls wp_localize_script() with $this->data() (including 'nonce' => wp_create_nonce('wp_rest')) on wp_enqueue_scripts, which runs on every public page render when the block assets are enqueued. This confirms the endpoint is designed for public use. The authorization model is a wp_rest nonce check plus a connection-status check (ReachApiHandler::is_authorized() at line 165-168), not a capability gate \u2014 both components are appropriate for a public subscription form. The endpoint allows any visitor to subscribe via the form the site owner published, which is the intended behavior.",
